{
     "session_summary": "User requested database migration from Postgres to Clickhouse.",
     "resolved_items": ["Schema translation verified", "Connection string validated"],
     "active_blockers": ["Foreign key constraints pending resolution"],
     "current_variables": {"target_table": "telemetry_logs", "batch_size": 5000}
   }
   ```
   This JSON summary replaces the raw conversational turns, preserving 100% of functional state while slashing 95% of active token memory.

